# =============================================================================
# 演化发布治理状态 (per-worktree release registry，运行时生成，不纳入版本控制)
# 注：config/provider-budget-grant.json 等 config 源文件仍纳入版本控制
# =============================================================================
.pi/extensions/novel-studio/config/evolution-release/

# Runtime execution traces are generated evidence, not production source.
traces/

# 密封生产身份包由受控发布流程导出并由部署层只读挂载；它不是源码。
# 未忽略会让 export-identity 污染冻结工作树，进而使生产指纹不可复现。
config/production-identity/active.pack.json

